# Security headers for every static response (Cloudflare Pages _headers).
# No Content-Security-Policy yet: the page runs inline boot scripts and
# loads from unpkg, Google Fonts, Google Sign-In, CARTO and Cloudinary, so a
# CSP needs testing on a real phone first — a wrong one blanks the app.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
